/****************************************************************************
 * Capture: dataset collection
 *
 * The crop that the classifier is about to read is written to the card as
 * an uncompressed BMP, one frame per file, so the training set is built
 * from exactly the pixels the model sees at run time - same rectangle,
 * same geometry, same camera.  Nothing here feeds back into the inference.
 *
 * Files land in <mountpoint>/eye_ds as <label>_NNNN.bmp with a shared
 * meta.txt holding the geometry of each frame, so a crop that was placed
 * badly can be found and dropped on the PC side without viewing 1100
 * images.
 ***************************************************************************/
```

