/****************************************************************************
 * Name: eye_cam_xspi_probe
 *
 * Description:
 *   Walk the HyperRAM window one access at a time, logging before each step
 *   so that a fault identifies exactly which access failed.  Reads are
 *   precise: they either return data or raise a precise bus error with a
 *   valid BFAR.  Writes are posted through the AXI write buffer, so a
 *   failure there surfaces later as an imprecise error.
