which case the data is not arriving because the channel is not running.  This
board runs NuttX in the non-secure world with the RIF active, and the port's
own notes say GPDMA1's compartment ID is fixed by the ROM and cannot be
reprogrammed, so it is worth knowing whether the channel even accepted its
configuration before looking further.

Dumped once, on the first transfer: the registers are rewritten per chunk and
a line per chunk would drown the log.
"""
